# This repository's overrides of lights-out's policy/merge.env (docs/adr/
# 0037 §5). KEY=VALUE, own-line comments, and every key under a
# "Provenance, measurement|external|decision:" line. A change to this file
# is high risk, and a PR is judged by its base's copy, never its own.

# Provenance, decision: a one-module example service; half the platform's
# 200 lines is already a large change here, so it goes to review sooner.
RISK_SIZE_MEDIUM_LINES=100
